# Copyright header exceptions for the joetoo-kwin source tarball
# Copyright 2026 Joseph Brendler
#
# Paths are relative to curated upstream joetoo-kwin/ root with leading ./.
# tarup does not check each listed file for a Joseph Brendler copyright header.
# The licensing metadata are exempt from the code/doc source-header rule.
# JSON forbids comments, so plugin metadata cannot contain a normal header.
# Do NOT list normal code, CMake, .conf, README, or test sources merely to
# bypass a missing header; fix their proper copyright attribution instead.
# Re-audit after selecting the final upstream source set.
./COPYRIGHT.exceptions
./LICENSES.package
./native/managed-close/metadata.json
